[Cheats/Replace New Game With Debug Menu This menu contains various options to view background images, event images, and unlock certain options. It also contains various route select optionsPage 1 Next page Next page.Start from the beginning Starts a new game.Quick start Sends you to the title screen.Run file Event select menu.Scenario Change Changes the game scenario.System flag setting Presumably finishes character routes when selected.Hidden option settings Unknown.Return to title Returns to the title screen.Page 2 Next page Next page.Message Check  Displays various text messages.Message Check Allows you to select messages based on the event files.Flow check It's not clear what's different about this option.Flow check Shows story choices only.Quick save check Doesn't work. Would likely test title background images. Quick save check Doesn't work.Page 3 Next page Next page.Event CG check Cycles through all of the CG images.Scenery BG check Cycles through all of the background images.Character check Doesn't appear to work.Face window check	Doesn't work.Character color check Doesn't seem to work properly.BGM check Doesn't work.SE check Doesn't work.Movie check Allows you to view the game's movies.BG fade check Tests various screen transition effects.]
